WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:08.240
New to volunteering? Here's how to sign up, sign Levy's packet online, and find your first shift, all from your phone.

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:13.187
Step one. On the Hub's volunteer page, tap Sign in with Google.

00:00:13.387 --> 00:00:17.580
Or, type your email in the box below. Either one works.

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:23.500
Step two. The Hub doesn't know your email yet, so tap, I'm new: sign me up.

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:30.047
Step three. Your email is already filled in. Add your name, phone, shirt size, and group.

00:00:30.247 --> 00:00:34.140
In the last box, type the student your hours count for.

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:40.772
Step four. If the volunteer is under eighteen, tap Yes, and add a parent and a parent phone.

00:00:40.972 --> 00:00:45.420
Your paperwork list adds a minor release, for a parent to sign.

00:00:46.270 --> 00:01:01.490
Step five. Open the Levy packet, and tap Save my info and sign online. It saves your info and opens Levy's packet to sign, with no printing. Already have a signed paper packet? Upload it here and tap Submit instead.

00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:06.790
Step six. Check that everything is right, then tap Yes, save it.

00:01:07.640 --> 00:01:12.249
Step seven. On Levy's packet, your name and initials are already filled in.

00:01:12.449 --> 00:01:16.560
Check each policy. The full packet is linked at the top.

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:21.208
Step eight. Answer the health questions, and sign with your finger.

00:01:21.408 --> 00:01:27.580
Then tap Sign and submit. You can add your Creating Legends certificate here now, or later.

00:01:28.430 --> 00:01:32.740
Step nine. Your volunteer page shows any paperwork that's still missing.

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:37.000
Once it's done, tap Open spots, pick a spot, and you're on.

00:01:37.850 --> 00:01:42.790
Questions? Email the IU liaison from the bottom of any Hub page.
